---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="404 — command not found · lobot.io"
  description="That path doesn't exist on lobot.io."
>
  <main class="shell not-found" aria-labelledby="err-heading">

    <p class="err-line" aria-hidden="true">lobot:~$ cd <span id="bad-path"></span></p>
    <p class="err-line" aria-hidden="true">bash: cd: <span id="bad-path-2"></span>: No such file or directory</p>

    <h1 id="err-heading"><span class="dim">404 —</span> command not found.</h1>

    <p>That path doesn't exist here. Maybe it moved, maybe it never shipped.<br>
    The rack knows nothing of it.</p>

    <a href="/" class="back">$ cd ~  # go home</a>

  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    (function () {
      var p = window.location.pathname || '/unknown';
      document.getElementById('bad-path').textContent = p;
      document.getElementById('bad-path-2').textContent = p;
    }());
  </script>
</Base>
